<div class="about">
  <img class="aboutimg" src="../../public/images/about.jpeg" alt="about" />
  <div class="content">
    <h2 class="linedeco">ABOUT US</h2>
    <span class="creamos">WE CREATE THE EXTRAORDINARY</span>
    <p class="abouttext">
      Founded by Giselle Said, creator of Stranger Kynki, the company is built
      on more than two decades of experience in creative direction, production
      and cultural curation, with projects for global brands such as Heineken,
      Netflix, Adidas, Coca-Cola, Nike and Red Bull, alongside international
      work with agencies across Argentina, Chile, Peru and Mexico.
    </p>
    <p class="abouttext">
      We create proprietary events through a sensory logic where sound, light,
      rhythm, flow and behavior operate as a unified system. Our work does not
      replicate existing models. It establishes new territories.
    </p>
    <!-- <button>discover more</button> -->
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .about {
    background-color: #0c0c09;
    display: flex;
    padding: 5rem;
  }
  .aboutimg {
    width: 35%;
    height: 35%;
    border-radius: 50%;
  }
  .content {
    margin: 1rem 5rem;
    width: 50%;
  }
  .linedeco {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    color: red;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .linedeco::after {
    content: "";
    width: 4rem;
    height: 1px;
    background: currentColor;
  }
  .creamos {
    font-size: 4rem;
  }
  .abouttext {
    margin: 2rem 0;
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    text-align: justify;
  }
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .about {
      flex-direction: column;
      padding: 0;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
    }
    .content {
      margin: 0;
      width: 85%;
    }
    .creamos {
      font-size: 2rem;
    }
    .aboutimg {
      width: 70%;
      margin: 3rem 0;
    }
  }
</style>
